    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84640c5fa4a137b1d432375e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的心中藏着比任何人都炽热的斗志。她的那个梦\n绝不是灿烂夺目的，而更像是成百上千倍炽热的火焰……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0587a6964b071018166f5cd39fde303207895945c6d69ce8cef16f172ab3d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
