    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55861ebf1cd2ec708234fc8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹的韧性是惊人的，即使是这样高强度的训练她也\n毫不畏惧。她的斗志非但没有减弱，反而更加高涨了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "02ee55621f50052d5c6a12286e3ee943f407d30270d8673e00c5d604d4549c9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068004.json",
      "json_path": [
