      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许她最大的武器应该是――\n『为了某人而去努力的力量』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb153f6446c484fc1a07ed7c7792554990a0ee5a4d984589f78fcc77cb2c6e67",
